# MANDATORY: Paste the FULL JSON content from your Firebase serviceAccountKey.json file here.
# STEP: Go to Firebase Console -> Project Settings -> Service Accounts -> Generate New Private Key
# DOWNLOAD the JSON file, OPEN it in a text editor (Notepad/VSCode).
# COPY everything from { to } inclusive.
# PASTE ONLY that JSON here. Do NOT paste any Node.js/Java code snippets like "FileInputStream" or "admin.credential.cert".
FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT=
